    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ラグナ遺跡</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Laguna Ruins</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ラグナ遺跡</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Laguna Ruins</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ラグナ遺跡</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Laguna Ruins</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>調査隊が来てるって言ってたけど、
姿が見えないじゃんか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You said that an investigation team is coming,
but I don't see 'em anywhere, do you?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>どうやら俺たちの方が先に
着いたらしいな････って言ってるそば
から来やがった　&lt;Kyle&gt;、隠れろ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It appears that we somehow managed to
get here before they did...and speak of
the devil, here they come. Kyle, hide!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ここか？
巨大レンズがあるという遺跡は</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So these are the ruins where
the gigantic Lens is said to be.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>はっ！　自分は以前、確かにこの遺跡で
レンズを目撃しました！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes sir! I personally observed the Lens during a
previous visit, so I can attest to its presence here!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>この遺跡はレンズが作られた時代の
都市であると考えられています</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It is believed that these ruins date back to the
era where cities were constructed out of Lenses.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>だから、レンズがあっても
不思議ではないと言うのか？
････疑わしいものだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And that is why you say that there is
nothing strange about a Lens being here?
...I somehow have my doubts.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <JapaneseText>現物を見れば
信じていただけるでしょう
レンズはこの中です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I hope that you will be able to
believe us once you see the actual
item. The Lens is inside here.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おい、ソーサラースコープを</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, bring out the Sorcerer's Scope.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <JapaneseText>どうしよう････
急がないと、あいつらに
レンズを取られちゃうよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What're we gonna do...
those guys will end up taking
the Lens if we don't hurry!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <JapaneseText>とはいえ、正面から
遺跡に入るのはヤバいな
あいつらと、はち合わせしちまう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Be that as it may, entering the
ruins from the front is chancy.
We may accidentally bump into them.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、あっちの横穴はどう？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then how about that tunnel over there?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ん････なんとか行けそうだな
&lt;Kyle&gt;、急ぐぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm...that looks like it just might work.
Kyle, let's get moving!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あれ、ここは････？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh, is this...?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ラグナ遺跡だな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Laguna Ruins.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <JapaneseText>かつては空中都市とよばれていた遺跡だが
あらかた調べつくされて
考古学的な価値はゼロって話だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The ruins of what used to be an aerial city,
but it's been completely destroyed. There's
no archeological value to it.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････････
････････････････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>......
............</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <JapaneseText>どうした？
気になるものでもあったか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's up?
Is there something on your mind?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いや、そうじゃないけど
ここにいると
なんだか不思議な感じがするんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, I'm not, but...
When I'm here,
I get this strange feeling.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <JapaneseText>不思議な感じ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Strange, isn't it?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <JapaneseText>口じゃうまく言えないよ
ただ、だれかが呼んでるような
それもよく知ってるはずのだれかが････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can't really put my finger on it.
But it's like someone's calling me.
And it's someone you know well...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おい、気味悪ぃな
うらみを残して死んだ女が････
なんてのはゴメンだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, I don't want a dead woman
with a creepy grin on her face.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <JapaneseText>そんなに気になるなら、いってこいよ
ここで待っててやるから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If it bothers you that much,
go ahead, I'll wait here for you.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <JapaneseText>うん、そうするよ
ごめんね、&lt;Loni&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, I will.
I'm sorry, &lt;Loni&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <JapaneseText>この辺から入っていった気がするけど････？
見つかったらマズイし、オレたちは横穴から
中に入ろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I think we went in from around here?
If they see us, we'll have to go in through the side hole.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ここが入口かなあ？
でも、開け方が分からないや
なにか道具が手に入ったら、また来てみよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder if this is the entrance.
I can't figure out how to open it,
we need to come back with some tools.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いってらっしゃいませ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good day.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{34}{08}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt;ガルドになりますが
お泊まりになりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It'll be &lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{34}{08}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt; gald a night.
Would you like to stay?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お泊まりになりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Would you like to stay?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;03:00000000&gt;　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;03:00000000&gt; Yes 
 No </EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ごゆっくりお休みください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good night.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おはようございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Good morning.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お金が足りません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not enough money.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <JapaneseText>またのおこしをお待ちしております</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>See you again soon.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{26}{16}{C0}を手に入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;item:FFFFFFFF&gt;を手に入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired &lt;item:FFFFFFFF&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{26}{1E}{C0}がありましたが
